[{"content":"\u003cp\u003eXử lý exception giúp code ổn định và dễ debug.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"ví-dụ\"\u003eVí dụ\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003etry\u003c/span\u003e {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eint\u003c/span\u003e result \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e 10 \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e/\u003c/span\u003e 0;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e} \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ecatch\u003c/span\u003e(ArithmeticException e) {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    System.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Cannot divide by zero!\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e} \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efinally\u003c/span\u003e {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    System.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Always executed\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"mẹo\"\u003eMẹo\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSử dụng \u003ccode\u003etry-with-resources\u003c/code\u003e cho AutoCloseable.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKhông catch generic \u003ccode\u003eException\u003c/code\u003e trừ khi thật sự cần.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Quản lý exception tốt giúp ứng dụng chạy ổn định và dễ bảo trì.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Cách xử lý exception trong Java một cách hiệu quả.","image":"/images/blogs/java-exception.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-exception-handling-tips/","title":"Java Exception Handling Tips"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eModules giúp tách code thành các file reusable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"ví-dụ\"\u003eVí dụ\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003emath.js\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eexport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eb\u003c/span\u003e) { \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e+\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eb\u003c/span\u003e; }\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eexport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003esub\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eb\u003c/span\u003e) { \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ea\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eb\u003c/span\u003e; }\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eapp.js\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e { \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e } \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efrom\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;./math.js\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#ae81ff\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e,\u003cspan style=\"color:#ae81ff\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e)); \u003cspan style=\"color:#75715e\"\u003e// 5\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Modules giúp tránh global scope pollution và tăng maintainability.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Học cách tổ chức code bằng ES6 modules trong JavaScript.","image":"/images/blogs/js-module.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-modules-explained/","title":"JavaScript Modules Explained"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eLập trình hàm (Functional Programming) trong Java được giới thiệu mạnh mẽ từ Java 8, mở ra cách tiếp cận mới cho việc viết code ngắn gọn, dễ đọc và ít lỗi hơn.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"1-tư-duy-lập-trình-hàm-là-gì\"\u003e1. Tư duy lập trình hàm là gì?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLập trình hàm tập trung vào việc sử dụng các \u003cstrong\u003ehàm không có side effect\u003c/strong\u003e, dữ liệu \u003cstrong\u003ebất biến (immutable)\u003c/strong\u003e và \u003cstrong\u003exử lý dữ liệu bằng hàm thuần túy (pure functions)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"2-lambda-expressions-trong-java\"\u003e2. Lambda Expressions trong Java\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLambda là cú pháp rút gọn để biểu diễn các biểu thức hàm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eList\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003eString\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e names \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e Arrays.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003easList\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;An\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bình\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Chi\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003enames.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eforEach\u003c/span\u003e(name \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e System.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Xin chào \u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e+\u003c/span\u003e name));\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ename -\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e là phần định nghĩa đầu vào.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSystem.out.println(...)\u003c/code\u003e là phần thực thi.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"3-stream-api--linh-hồn-của-functional-java\"\u003e3. Stream API – Linh hồn của Functional Java\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStream API giúp xử lý dữ liệu theo chuỗi thao tác như filter, map, reduce…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eList\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003eInteger\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e numbers \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e Arrays.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003easList\u003c/span\u003e(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eint\u003c/span\u003e sum \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e numbers.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003estream\u003c/span\u003e()\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e                 .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efilter\u003c/span\u003e(n \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e n \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e%\u003c/span\u003e 2 \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e==\u003c/span\u003e 0)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e                 .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003emapToInt\u003c/span\u003e(n \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e n \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e n)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e                 .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003esum\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSystem.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Tổng bình phương các số chẵn: \u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e+\u003c/span\u003e sum);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"4-ưu-điểm-của-functional-programming\"\u003e4. Ưu điểm của Functional Programming\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDễ song song hóa (parallel processing).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDễ bảo trì và kiểm thử.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCode ngắn gọn, ít lỗi hơn.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"5-khi-nào-nên-dùng\"\u003e5. Khi nào nên dùng?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFunctional programming rất phù hợp khi xử lý \u003cstrong\u003etập dữ liệu lớn\u003c/strong\u003e, hoặc cần \u003cstrong\u003ebiến đổi dữ liệu liên tục\u003c/strong\u003e (data transformation). Tuy nhiên, không nên lạm dụng trong các đoạn code yêu cầu thay đổi trạng thái.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKết luận:\u003c/strong\u003e Java Functional Programming không chỉ giúp code ngắn gọn hơn mà còn giúp phát triển ứng dụng hiện đại, linh hoạt và hiệu quả hơn.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Tận dụng lambda và streams để viết code theo phong cách functional trong Java.","image":"/images/blogs/java-functional.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/functional-programming-in-java/","title":"Functional Programming in Java"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEvent Loop là trái tim của JS runtime.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"nguyên-lý-hoạt-động\"\u003eNguyên lý hoạt động\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Stack\u003c/strong\u003e: Nơi lưu function đang chạy.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMessage Queue\u003c/strong\u003e: Nơi lưu callback.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvent Loop\u003c/strong\u003e: Kiểm tra stack rỗng để xử lý queue.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Start\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003esetTimeout\u003c/span\u003e(() =\u0026gt; \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Timeout\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e), \u003cspan style=\"color:#ae81ff\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;End\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"output\"\u003eOutput\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eStart\r\nEnd\r\nTimeout\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Hiểu event loop giúp debug async code và promise chaining dễ dàng hơn.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Hiểu rõ cơ chế event loop để xử lý async code trong JavaScript.","image":"/images/blogs/eventloop.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-event-loop-demystified/","title":"JavaScript Event Loop Demystified"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eJava 17 mang đến nhiều cải tiến hữu ích.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"nổi-bật\"\u003eNổi bật\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSealed Classes\u003c/strong\u003e: Giới hạn class con.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecords\u003c/strong\u003e: Data class ngắn gọn.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePattern Matching for switch\u003c/strong\u003e: Dễ đọc hơn.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003erecord\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ePoint\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eint\u003c/span\u003e x, \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eint\u003c/span\u003e y) {}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePoint p \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003enew\u003c/span\u003e Point(1, 2);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSystem.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(p.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ex\u003c/span\u003e());\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Cập nhật lên Java 17 để tận dụng các tính năng hiện đại và tối ưu code.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Những tính năng mới thú vị trong Java 17 bạn nên thử.","image":"/images/blogs/java17.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-17-features-you-must-know/","title":"Java 17 Features You Must Know"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eAsync/Await là cú pháp được giới thiệu từ ES2017 giúp việc xử lý các tác vụ bất đồng bộ (asynchronous) trở nên dễ đọc và bảo trì hơn. Thay vì phải sử dụng callback hoặc Promise chaining phức tạp, bạn có thể viết code gần giống như lập trình đồng bộ.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"1-tổng-quan-về-asyncawait\"\u003e1. Tổng quan về Async/Await\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003easync\u003c/code\u003e biến một hàm bình thường thành một Promise.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eawait\u003c/code\u003e giúp “chờ” một Promise hoàn thành trước khi thực thi dòng lệnh tiếp theo.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eĐiều này đặc biệt hữu ích khi làm việc với API hoặc xử lý dữ liệu từ server.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"2-ví-dụ-cơ-bản\"\u003e2. Ví dụ cơ bản\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003easync\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efetchData\u003c/span\u003e() {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003etry\u003c/span\u003e {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003elet\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eresponse\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eawait\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efetch\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;https://api.example.com/data\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003elet\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003edata\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eawait\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eresponse\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ejson\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Dữ liệu nhận được:\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003edata\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  } \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ecatch\u003c/span\u003e (\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eerror\u003c/span\u003e) {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eerror\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Lỗi khi fetch dữ liệu:\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eerror\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  }\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efetchData\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"3-ưu-điểm-của-asyncawait\"\u003e3. Ưu điểm của Async/Await\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCú pháp rõ ràng, dễ hiểu.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGiảm thiểu callback hell.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDễ dàng gỡ lỗi và bảo trì.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"4-một-số-lưu-ý-quan-trọng\"\u003e4. Một số lưu ý quan trọng\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eawait\u003c/code\u003e chỉ hoạt động bên trong hàm được khai báo \u003ccode\u003easync\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCó thể dùng \u003ccode\u003ePromise.all()\u003c/code\u003e để chạy nhiều tác vụ bất đồng bộ song song.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNên luôn dùng \u003ccode\u003etry...catch\u003c/code\u003e để xử lý lỗi.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003easync\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eloadMultipleData\u003c/span\u003e() {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003etry\u003c/span\u003e {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003econst\u003c/span\u003e [\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003euser\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eposts\u003c/span\u003e] \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003eawait\u003c/span\u003e Promise.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eall\u003c/span\u003e([\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e      \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efetch\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;/api/user\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e),\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e      \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efetch\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;/api/posts\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    ]);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Tải xong dữ liệu người dùng và bài viết\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  } \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ecatch\u003c/span\u003e (\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ee\u003c/span\u003e) {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eerror\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#39;Lỗi khi tải dữ liệu:\u0026#39;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ee\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  }\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTổng kết:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ccode\u003easync/await\u003c/code\u003e là cách tiếp cận hiện đại và hiệu quả để xử lý bất đồng bộ trong JavaScript. Nó giúp code trở nên sáng sủa, dễ hiểu, và ít lỗi hơn.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Học cách xử lý asynchronous code trong JavaScript dễ dàng với async/await.","image":"/images/blogs/js-async.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/async-await-in-javascript/","title":"Async/Await in JavaScript"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eGenerics giúp code Java an toàn kiểu dữ liệu và dễ bảo trì.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"vì-sao-cần-sử-dụng-generics\"\u003eVì sao cần sử dụng Generics?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eList\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003eString\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e names \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003enew\u003c/span\u003e ArrayList\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003enames.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eadd\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Alice\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#75715e\"\u003e// names.add(10); // Lỗi biên dịch!\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"mẹo\"\u003eMẹo\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSử dụng \u003ccode\u003e\u0026lt;T\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e cho class hoặc method.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGiúp tránh casting thủ công.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Generics tăng type-safety nhưng không thể sử dụng với primitive types trực tiếp.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Tìm hiểu về generics và cách chúng giúp code an toàn hơn.","image":"/images/blogs/java-generic.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-generics-explained/","title":"Java Generics Explained"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eClosures là một trong những khái niệm mạnh mẽ nhất trong JavaScript.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"closure-là-gì\"\u003eClosure là gì?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClosure là khi một function nhớ được scope bên ngoài nó ngay cả khi function đó được gọi ở nơi khác:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003emakeCounter\u003c/span\u003e() {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003elet\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecount\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#ae81ff\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e() {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecount\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e++\u003c/span\u003e;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecount\u003c/span\u003e;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  }\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003econst\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecounter\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003emakeCounter\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecounter\u003c/span\u003e()); \u003cspan style=\"color:#75715e\"\u003e// 1\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#75715e\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003econsole\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elog\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecounter\u003c/span\u003e()); \u003cspan style=\"color:#75715e\"\u003e// 2\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 id=\"mẹo\"\u003eMẹo\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDùng closures để tạo private variables.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTránh lạm dụng closures trong vòng lặp để prevent memory leaks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c!-- raw HTML omitted --\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eN.B.\u003c/strong\u003e Closures là chìa khóa để hiểu nhiều pattern trong JS như module hoặc callback.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Khám phá sức mạnh của closures trong JavaScript.","image":"/images/blogs/js-closures.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/understanding-javascript-closures/","title":"Understanding JavaScript Closures"},{"content":"\u003cp\u003eStream API là một trong những tính năng nổi bật của Java 8, giúp thao tác dữ liệu dễ dàng, hiệu quả và theo phong cách functional.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"1-stream-là-gì\"\u003e1. Stream là gì?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStream là chuỗi các phần tử dữ liệu hỗ trợ nhiều phép biến đổi (transformation) và tổng hợp (aggregation) mà không cần thay đổi cấu trúc dữ liệu gốc.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"2-cách-tạo-stream\"\u003e2. Cách tạo Stream\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBạn có thể tạo Stream từ các nguồn dữ liệu như Collection, Array, hoặc I/O channel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eList\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003eString\u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e names \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e Arrays.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003easList\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Alice\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bob\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Charlie\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Anna\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003enames.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003estream\u003c/span\u003e()\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e     .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efilter\u003c/span\u003e(name \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e name.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003estartsWith\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;A\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e))\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e     .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003emap\u003c/span\u003e(String::toUpperCase)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e     .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003esorted\u003c/span\u003e()\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e     .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eforEach\u003c/span\u003e(System.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e::println);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"3-các-thao-tác-phổ-biến-trong-stream\"\u003e3. Các thao tác phổ biến trong Stream\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n  \u003cthead\u003e\n      \u003ctr\u003e\n          \u003cth\u003ePhương thức\u003c/th\u003e\n          \u003cth\u003eMô tả\u003c/th\u003e\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\n  \u003c/thead\u003e\n  \u003ctbody\u003e\n      \u003ctr\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003efilter()\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003eLọc phần tử theo điều kiện\u003c/td\u003e\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\n      \u003ctr\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003emap()\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003eBiến đổi dữ liệu\u003c/td\u003e\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\n      \u003ctr\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003esorted()\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003eSắp xếp\u003c/td\u003e\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\n      \u003ctr\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003ecollect()\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n          \u003ctd\u003eGom kết quả về Collection hoặc giá trị\u003c/td\u003e\n      \u003c/tr\u003e\n  \u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"4-lazy-evaluation-và-performance\"\u003e4. Lazy Evaluation và Performance\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStream sử dụng \u003cstrong\u003elazy evaluation\u003c/strong\u003e, nghĩa là chỉ khi bạn gọi các thao tác terminal như \u003ccode\u003eforEach\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode\u003ecollect\u003c/code\u003e, hoặc \u003ccode\u003ecount\u003c/code\u003e thì luồng dữ liệu mới thực sự được xử lý.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"5-parallel-streams\"\u003e5. Parallel Streams\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJava hỗ trợ \u003ccode\u003eparallelStream()\u003c/code\u003e để tận dụng đa luồng, giúp tăng tốc độ xử lý với dữ liệu lớn.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-java\" data-lang=\"java\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#66d9ef\"\u003elong\u003c/span\u003e count \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e names.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eparallelStream\u003c/span\u003e()\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e                  .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003efilter\u003c/span\u003e(n \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e n.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003elength\u003c/span\u003e() \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e 3)\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e                  .\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003ecount\u003c/span\u003e();\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSystem.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eout\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan style=\"color:#a6e22e\"\u003eprintln\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan style=\"color:#e6db74\"\u003e\u0026#34;Số tên dài hơn 3 ký tự: \u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#f92672\"\u003e+\u003c/span\u003e count);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKết luận:\u003c/strong\u003e Sử dụng Stream giúp viết code Java hiện đại, dễ hiểu và mang lại hiệu suất cao, đặc biệt trong các tác vụ xử lý dữ liệu phức tạp.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description":"Học cách sử dụng Java Streams để xử lý dữ liệu dễ dàng.","image":"/images/blogs/java-streams.png","permalink":"https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-streams-made-easy/","title":"Java Streams Made Easy"}]